  "/careers/game-mathematician": {
    "title": "Game Mathematician — Careers | Nexenova Studios",
    "description": "Design the numbers behind our economies and multiplayer balance — and prove they hold up before launch.",
    "canonical": "https://nexenovastudios.com/careers/game-mathematician",
    "image": "https://nexenovastudios.com/og-image.jpg",
    "imageAlt": "Nexenova Studios — AI-powered indie mobile game studio",
    "imageSize": {
      "width": "1200",
      "height": "630"
    },
    "type": "website",
    "robots": "index,follow",
    "jsonLd": [
      "{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Game Mathematician\",\"description\":\"## About the role\\n\\nWe make mobile games where the math has to feel fair to a player on level 5 and still hold \\n  up on level 500. We’re looking for a game mathematician who can design, model, and simulate the economy and \\n  multiplayer systems across our titles — and tune them post-launch with data, not vibes.\\n\\nYou’ll work alongside our\\n   designers and engineers on every title in the pipeline, from soft-launch tuning on **Smashy Qube** to the \\n  matchmaking math behind future multiplayer titles.\\n\\n## What you’ll do\\n\\n- Design and **simulate game economies**:\\n   currency sources and sinks, progression curves, drop rates, IAP pricing ladders, time-to-progress\\n- Build \\n  **mathematical models** in spreadsheets and Python (or similar) and stress-test them before a single line of game \\n  code is written\\n- Tune **multiplayer balance**: matchmaking rating systems (Elo / Glicko / TrueSkill), reward \\n  parity across skill bands, anti-snowballing in PvP\\n- Define **KPIs and analytics events** with the team, then dig \\n  into the data to validate or kill assumptions post-launch\\n- Run **A/B tests** on tuning changes; report results in \\n  plain English\\n- Own the **balance docs** — your spreadsheets are the source of truth, not a memo nobody reads\\n\\n##\\n   What we’re looking for\\n\\n- Strong background in **math, statistics, economics, CS, or related** quantitative \\n  field\\n- **3+ years** designing or balancing systems for shipped F2P / live-ops games, or equivalent quantitative \\n  product work\\n- Fluency in **spreadsheet modeling** (Excel/Sheets — pivot tables, lookups, monte-carlo with macros\\n  or array formulas) and **scripting** (Python, R, or similar) for simulations\\n- Deep understanding of F2P economy\\n  fundamentals — soft/hard currencies, drop tables, progression pacing, IAP price ladders\\n- For multiplayer roles:\\n  working knowledge of **matchmaking rating systems** and the fairness math that makes them feel honest\\n- Comfort\\n  interpreting analytics dashboards (Amplitude, GameAnalytics, or similar) and asking the next question yourself\\n\\n##\\n   Nice to have\\n\\n- Shipped a **PvP** or **competitive multiplayer** mobile title (Clash Royale–style, archero-style,\\n   .io games)\\n- Experience with **puzzle or hyper-casual** economy design — the small-number tuning that makes a\\n  session feel exactly the right length\\n- Familiarity with **A/B testing platforms** and statistical significance\\n  testing\\n- Background in board game / card game design as a hobby\\n\\n## Why us\\n\\n- Small team, fast iteration —\\n  your model gets tested in a live build the same week you ship it\\n- Real autonomy over balance decisions; no\\n  committee for every drop-rate tweak\\n- Studio-wide impact — you touch every title in the pipeline\\n\\n## How to\\n  apply\\n\\nSend a short note about a game system you tuned (and what the numbers were before/after) to\\n  **tech@nexenovastudios.com** with the subject `Game Mathematician — \\u003cyour name>`.\",\"datePosted\":\"2026-05-23T04:57:24.176508+00:00\",\"employmentType\":\"FULL_TIME\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nexenova Studios\",\"sameAs\":\"https://nexenovastudios.com\",\"logo\":\"https://nexenovastudios.com/icon-512.png\"},\"directApply\":true,\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Noida, UP (India)\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}}",
      "{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://nexenovastudios.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Careers\",\"item\":\"https://nexenovastudios.com/careers\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Game Mathematician\",\"item\":\"https://nexenovastudios.com/careers/game-mathematician\"}]}"
    ]
  },
